sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Match identity, assertion and role trust
accDescr: The IdP emits authorized role mappings, the client exchanges a matching assertion with STS, and role trust decides whether a session is issued.
participant U as Employee
participant I as Corporate IdP
participant C as Federation client
participant S as AWS STS
U->>I: Authenticate
I-->>C: Signed assertion + user role mappings
C->>S: RoleArn + PrincipalArn + SAMLAssertion
S->>S: Evaluate role trust and assertion conditions
alt Trust and assertion match
S-->>C: Temporary credentials
else Missing mapping or mismatch
S-->>C: Federation request denied
end
